  "unmapped_files": [],
  "taxonomy_notes": [
    "Primary zones describe responsibility, not directory layout. No source files move. WasmVM/Hosts belongs to Browser; VM execution stays in WASM.",
    "Style includes CSS in Rendering and SVGCSS in the lab. Rendering keeps layout, paint, scene, fonts and Unicode; Graphics keeps raster/vector algorithms, GPU, codecs and ML.",
    "JSON-LD, CSVW and YAML readers belong to JSON. RDF includes graph storage and planners. XPath functions and shared regex live in XML; secondary shared-foundation tags show their wider use.",
    "Browser includes package entry points, general tools, dataflow infrastructure and shared primitives. An import into this zone need not execute browser code. Future taxonomy changes may separate shared foundations; review module crossings before doing so.",
    "Host transport code stays in Browser even when it moves graphics or network bytes. Tests and fixtures stay counted with their primary responsibility. Some test and proof filenames have secondary tags; these tags are not a complete test classifier.",
    "Rules use case-sensitive fnmatch on full repository-relative paths; * crosses /. They are unordered unions with explicit exclusions. Exactly one rule must match every inventory file. No fallback exists for a new core Lean subtree."
  ],
  "review_notes": [
    {
      "statement": "Rendering → Network: font shaping reuses the URL subtree’s Unicode mark data. Consider a shared Unicode data module; this import is not evidence of a fetch.",
      "modules": [
