      ],
      "obligation": "Proposed. Model a policy-carrying loader adapter and its trace. Current loaders are supplied parameters; absence of imports does not constrain their construction."
    },
    {
      "statement": "Style computation has no network effects; its source import closure contains no Network module.",
      "modules": [
